  "actualIntroductionCreditsResetText": [
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Static delivery, with saved configuration in browser storage and service requests described below. Configuration comes from the URL;\nprayer times come from the free Aladhan API.\nThis CP9 integration candidate is not the deployed main version. It adds an\nadmitted star catalogue and physical sky in an optional worker while preserving\nthe prayer widget. See integration, evidence and open gates."
    },
    {
      "tag": "LI",
      "text": "Reset scope. Reset removes only the saved widget configuration (salah_widget:config:v1); it does not erase prayer/weather caches or data held by external providers. Successful removal may re-detect the area and issue the coarse request above. Failed removal reports the failure and leaves the existing target usable."
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Prayer time calculations by the Aladhan API, and\nweather by Open-Meteo \u2014 both free and key-less. These\nbrowser requests carry the configured location and request context. Settings\nand caches are stored in the browser when storage is available.\nProvider retention or handling is not established by this widget-source description."
    }
  ],
